                        "source_xml_line":  2084,
                        "string_id":  "shurup_conteiner_dialog_phrase_4",
                        "occurrence":  1,
                        "EN":  "Well, let me see... Holy shit, that\u0027s a military grade reinforced hard case! Where\u0027d you dig it up?",
                        "JA_current":  "Well, let me see... Holy shit, that\u0027s a military grade reinforced hard case! Where\u0027d you dig it up?",
                        "JA_new":  "どれどれ……なんてこった、軍用の強化ハードケースじゃないか！ どこで見つけた？",
