                        "string_id":  "shurup_conteiner_dialog_phrase_6",
                        "occurrence":  1,
                        "EN":  "I can open it, but it will take time. In the meantime, prepare an artifact called Mica, and I\u0027ll take it as payment. Because it\u0027s going to take me a lot of sweat, so I want you to sweat a little yourself.",
